<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">关于认真做好2022~2023学年第一学期本科教育教学检查工作的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2022-09-26&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 12223)</script>)</SPAN></P>
     
    <p>
        <UL style="list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:30px;"> 
            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=9D2C6EF258EA5432362F91799614228E" target="_blank">附件.docx</a>】已下载<span id="nattach6550581"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(6550581,1070628979,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
        </UL>
    </p>
    <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:Helvetica; panose-1:2 11 6 4 2 2 2 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:华文中宋; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:方正小标宋简体;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@华文中宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 4 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";} @font-face {font-family:"\@方正小标宋简体";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {mso-style-link:"页眉 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {mso-style-link:"页脚 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoBodyText, li.MsoBodyText, div.MsoBodyText {mso-style-link:"正文文本 Char"; margin-top:1.55pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:90.0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:#0563C1; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:purple; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; text-indent:21.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} span.Char {mso-style-name:"页眉 Char"; mso-style-link:页眉;} span.Char0 {mso-style-name:"页脚 Char"; mso-style-link:页脚;} span.Char1 {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} span.Char2 {mso-style-name:"正文文本 Char"; mso-style-link:正文文本; font-family:仿宋_GB2312;}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} @page Section2 {size:841.9pt 595.3pt; margin:90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section2 {page:Section2;}  /* List Definitions */  ol {margin-bottom:0cm;} ul {margin-bottom:0cm;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各单位：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">根据上级部门和学校疫情防控安排，自<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>年<span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">26</span>日（周一）起，学校全面恢复本科线下教学。为严格本科教育教学过程管理，维护学校正常教学秩序，及时发现改进教学中的问题，建设优良教风学风，学校开展本科教育教学检查，为期一周，相关安排通知如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">一、检查内容</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">教学秩序：教师到岗情况、学生到课情况、教师教学言行、课堂纪律等。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">教学准备：备课情况（包括教材、教案、讲义等）、线上资源建设进展、实验室准备等。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">课堂教学：教学方式、师生互动、教学效果等情况；授课班级如有因疫情未返校学生，需同步开启“西电智课”平台。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">教学保障条件：线上教学网络、教室基础设施、教学设备、卫生状况等情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="background: white; line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">材料归档：试卷、毕业设计（论文）、教学一览表等相关材料归档情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">二、检查形式</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">教学检查采取线上线下相结合的形式，以各学院自查为主，学校集中教学检查和抽查为辅。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院成立学校教学检查组，负责对全校教学运行整体情况进行检查。各教学单位成立院内检查工作组，由教育教学主管领导带队开展检查。学校对各学院的教学状态和教学检查工作进行抽查，并给予综合评价，评价结果纳入年度本科教育教学工作考核。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">三、注意事项</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为保证教学秩序有序运行，各学院应及时提醒授课教师做好教学准备等工作，留出时间余量，避免上课迟到。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">教师如因防疫静态管理需采取线上授课的，须有助教到教室协助教学。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">严格执行课程管理规定，如有更换任课教师、调课、申请线上授课等情况，应在规定时间内报本科生院审批。若出现突发情况，按紧急事件流程，妥善处理，并及时向本科生院备案。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">全面恢复线下教学后，在校学生应按时到教室上课（防疫静态管理除外），如有特殊情况需履行请假手续。学院和书院应实时掌握学生的基本情况，督促学生按时上课（尤其是高年级学生），共同营造良好的学风。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">各单位要重视本科教育教学检查工作，对恢复线下教学准备情况、教学保障情况及上课情况进行全面认真检查，对检查工作中发现的问题要及时沟通、尽快解决，并做好记录，以保证教学工作的正常运行。如有异常情况，请填写“本科教育教学检查异常情况记录表”，并于<span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">30</span>日前报本科生院汇总。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">请各单位认真组织教育教学检查，用扎实细致的工作保证本科教学工作的规范运行。学校将汇总检查结果并进行全校通报。</span><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">在检查中如遇到任何问题，请及时与本科生院质监中心联系。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联系人：姜超华，张志波 </span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联系电话：<span lang="EN-US">81891791</span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联系邮箱：<span lang="EN-US">zlglk@xidian.edu.cn</span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; word-break: break-all; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vsb_temp-mode: char;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">25</span>日</span></p>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></DIV>
   
    
